1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:00,909
Salah orang.

2
00:00:01,320 --> 00:00:03,457
Tapi kau jelas…

3
00:00:03,825 --> 00:00:05,837
Tuan, silakan pulang.

4
00:00:07,859 --> 00:00:08,676
Dia kenal Kak A-Ling?

5
00:00:09,414 --> 00:00:09,839
Entah.

6
00:00:10,195 --> 00:00:11,767
Kalau mau, dia cerita.

7
00:00:12,051 --> 00:00:12,722
Belum tidur?

8
00:00:13,251 --> 00:00:14,337
Kau mau tanya.

9
00:00:14,451 --> 00:00:14,902
Mau.

10
00:00:14,980 --> 00:00:16,041
Tapi kau enggan.

11
00:00:16,359 --> 00:00:18,294
Dia melihatku di balik tembok tinggi.

12
00:00:19,034 --> 00:00:19,365
Jangan tanya lagi.

13
00:00:20,234 --> 00:00:21,475
Baik, nggak tanya.

14
00:00:21,634 --> 00:00:23,935
A-Ling, poin suka plus empat.

15
00:00:24,570 --> 00:00:25,556
Tiga bulan,

16
00:00:26,155 --> 00:00:28,051
setetes pun nggak turun.

17
00:00:28,129 --> 00:00:29,339
Benih nggak nunggu hujan.

18
00:00:29,403 --> 00:00:30,409
Bangunkan dulu.

19
00:00:30,738 --> 00:00:32,053
Bertunas!

20
00:00:32,499 --> 00:00:34,807
Xu Yan, tiga hari sudah bertunas!

21
00:00:34,877 --> 00:00:35,345
Kak Xu!

22
00:00:35,691 --> 00:00:37,319
Su… sungainya putus!

23
00:00:42,653 --> 00:00:44,024
Di hulu nggak ada air,

24
00:00:44,092 --> 00:00:45,893
sawah bakal mati semua!

25
00:00:46,037 --> 00:00:47,051
Sawahnya Qian?

26
00:00:47,367 --> 00:00:47,900
Keluarga Qian…

27
00:00:48,470 --> 00:00:50,418
Sawahnya masih hijau.

28
00:00:50,487 --> 00:00:51,952
Harga beras,

29
00:00:52,021 --> 00:00:54,767
naik tiga puluh persen lagi.

30
00:00:54,843 --> 00:00:57,613
Langit nggak kasih hujan,

31
00:00:58,435 --> 00:01:01,275
langit yang hitung uangku.

32
00:01:01,715 --> 00:01:02,552
Misi kekeringan:

33
00:01:03,379 --> 00:01:07,647
dalam sepuluh hari, sawah Liuxi harus berair.

34
00:01:07,742 --> 00:01:10,583
Gagal: benih padi mati.

35
00:01:10,662 --> 00:01:12,041
Ke hulu.

36
00:01:15,044 --> 00:01:16,123
Kak Xu, lihat!

37
00:01:18,865 --> 00:01:20,781
Airnya dialirkan ke Qian!

38
00:01:20,857 --> 00:01:22,483
Balikin air kami!

39
00:01:22,549 --> 00:01:23,415
Erniu!
